    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NAB 2 MI\nTRADE ENVOYS HERE\nMembers of the Forbes Trade Mission to the Orient arrived\nthis morning to look into local conditions\naffecting American\ntrade. The mission members are, left to right in upper photo,\nLouis C. Jones; Thomas Y. Wickham, and Harold M. Bixby. Low-\ner photo shows the missioners surrounded by the reception com-\nmittee composed of Director Balmaceda, H. B. Pond, Arsenio Luz,\nJ. Boss, Toribio Teodoro and other prominent business men."
    ],
